'''Cay Ploon Kett''' was an individual who,<ref name="Rebel Resolve">{{Rebels|Rebel Resolve}}</ref> approximately four [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Battle of Yavin]],<ref name="Star Wars: Galactic Atlas">"[[Rebel Resolve]]" directly follows "[[Call to Action]]," which ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates to [[4 BBY]].</ref> was imprisoned along with many others by the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Rebel Resolve" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The name "Cay Ploon Kett" first appeared in "[[Rebel Resolve]]," the twelfth episode of [[Star Wars Rebels Season One|the first season]] of ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''. Strikingly similar to "[[Kilian Plunkett|K. Plunkett]]," the name was written in [[Aurebesh]] in a prisoner data file.<ref name="Rebel Resolve" />

